<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA TRADE MISSION TO VISIT JAPAN, S.KOREA.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA TRADE MISSION TO VISIT JAPAN, S.KOREA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Trade and Industry Minister Alec Erwin will head a trade and investment mission to Japan and South Korea in November, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said firms interesting in joining the mission should contact the department of trade and industry. </p>
<p>The mission would target food and juices, footwear and leather goods, building materials, auto components, electronics, chemicals and tourism infrastructure.</p>
<p>- Johannesburg newsroom +2711 482-1003</p>
